{
  "formatVersion": 2,
  "layers": [
    {
      "@comment": "Golems wander at about 0.0496 blocks a tick, just under the MOVING_HORIZONTALLY dead zone (0.05), so the walk goes by the golem's own speed thresholds, apart to keep it from flickering. Between the two thresholds the selector chooses nothing, so the golem keeps standing or walking; landing between them, it walks (the jump's connection).",
      "@expressions": {
        "walkStart": 0.02,
        "walkStop": 0.01,
        "jumping": {"or": ["AIRBORNE", {"lt": ["ticksAfterTouchdown", 1]}]}
      },
      "select": [
        {"when": "jumping", "then": "jump"},
        {"when": {"ge": ["xzMotionMagnitude", "walkStart"]}, "then": "walk"},
        {"when": {"lt": ["xzMotionMagnitude", "walkStop"]}, "then": "stand"}
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "stand": {
          "core:pose": {
            "pose": [
              {
                "core:clip": {"animationKey": "mobends:bends/animations/iron_golem/rest.json"},
                "@damping": {
                  "rightArm": 0.5,
                  "leftArm": 0.5,
                  "rightForeArm": 0.5,
                  "leftForeArm": 0.5,
                  "rightLeg": 0.5,
                  "leftLeg": 0.5,
                  "rightForeLeg": 0.5,
                  "leftForeLeg": 0.5
                }
              },
              {
                "core:clip": {
                  "animationKey": "mobends:bends/animations/iron_golem/idle.json",
                  "frame": {"mod": [{"mul": ["ticks", 0.07]}, "clipLength"]}
                },
                "@damping": {"head": 0.5, "body": 0.5}
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "head", "axis": "Y", "angle": "headYaw"},
                "@space": "PRE",
                "@damping": {"head": 0.5}
              },
              {"core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "head", "axis": "X", "angle": "headPitch"}, "@space": "POST"},
              {
                "@when": {"gt": ["attackTimer", 0]},
                "core:clip": {"animationKey": "mobends:bends/animations/iron_golem/attack.json", "frame": "attackTimer"},
                "@damping": {"rightArm": 0.8, "leftArm": 0.8, "rightForeArm": 0.6, "leftForeArm": 0.6}
              }
            ]
          },
          "@tags": ["stand"]
        },
        "walk": {
          "core:pose": {
            "pose": [
              {
                "core:clip": {"animationKey": "mobends:bends/animations/iron_golem/rest.json"},
                "@damping": {
                  "rightArm": 0.5,
                  "leftArm": 0.5,
                  "rightForeArm": 0.5,
                  "leftForeArm": 0.5,
                  "rightLeg": 0.5,
                  "leftLeg": 0.5,
                  "rightForeLeg": 0.5,
                  "leftForeLeg": 0.5
                }
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "body", "axis": "X", "angle": 0},
                "@space": "OVERRIDE",
                "@damping": {"body": 0.5}
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "head", "axis": "Y", "angle": "headYaw"},
                "@space": "OVERRIDE",
                "@damping": {"head": 0.5}
              },
              {"core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "head", "axis": "X", "angle": "headPitch"}, "@space": "POST"},
              {
                "@when": {"gt": ["attackTimer", 0]},
                "core:clip": {"animationKey": "mobends:bends/animations/iron_golem/attack.json", "frame": "attackTimer"},
                "@damping": {"rightArm": 0.8, "leftArm": 0.8, "rightForeArm": 0.6, "leftForeArm": 0.6}
              }
            ]
          },
          "@tags": ["walk"]
        },
        "jump": {
          "core:pose": {
            "pose": [
              {
                "core:clip": {"animationKey": "mobends:bends/animations/iron_golem/jump.json"},
                "@damping": {"rightLeg": 0.8, "leftLeg": 0.8, "rightForeLeg": 0.6, "leftForeLeg": 0.6}
              },
              {
                "core:clip": {
                  "animationKey": "mobends:bends/animations/iron_golem/rest.json",
                  "bones": ["rightArm", "leftArm", "rightForeArm", "leftForeArm"]
                },
                "@damping": {"rightArm": 0.5, "leftArm": 0.5, "rightForeArm": 0.5, "leftForeArm": 0.5}
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "body", "axis": "X", "angle": 0},
                "@space": "OVERRIDE",
                "@damping": {"body": 0.5}
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "head", "axis": "Y", "angle": "headYaw"},
                "@space": "OVERRIDE",
                "@damping": {"head": 0.5}
              },
              {"core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "head", "axis": "X", "angle": "headPitch"}, "@space": "POST"},
              {
                "@when": {"gt": ["attackTimer", 0]},
                "core:clip": {"animationKey": "mobends:bends/animations/iron_golem/attack.json", "frame": "attackTimer"},
                "@damping": {"rightArm": 0.8, "leftArm": 0.8, "rightForeArm": 0.6, "leftForeArm": 0.6}
              }
            ]
          },
          "@tags": ["jump"],
          "@connections": [
            {
              "when": {"and": [{"not": ["jumping"]}, {"ge": ["xzMotionMagnitude", "walkStop"]}]},
              "then": "walk"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "@comment": "The golem stands and walks on its feet: step_turn plants them in the world, turns the body only as far as they have stepped (the leg on the side of the turn first) and, walking, steps the foot left behind to where the body will be, shifting and rolling the weight over the planted one. It is off while the golem jumps. Vanilla rocks the whole golem side to side while it walks (RenderIronGolem.applyRotations: 6.5° on a triangle wave of the limb swing, while limbSwingAmount >= 0.01); the render rotation turns it back first. The upper body reacts: the torso leads a turn, the arms lag behind it, swing against the legs and out when a foot lands, the head keeps looking where the golem looks.",
      "defaultOnEntry": "planted",
      "nodes": {
        "planted": {
          "core:pose": {
            "pose": [
              {
                "core:accumulate": {
                  "name": "onFeet",
                  "rate": {"if": [{"core:action": ["jump"]}, -0.15, 0.15]},
                  "min": 0,
                  "max": 1
                }
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "renderRotation", "axis": "Z", "angle": "vanillaRock"},
                "@space": "OVERRIDE",
                "@snap": true
              },
              {
                "core:step_turn": {
                  "weight": "onFeet",
                  "legs": [
                    {
                      "upper": "leftLeg",
                      "lower": "leftForeLeg",
                      "hip": [-4, 11, 0],
                      "knee": [0, 5, -3],
                      "foot": [-0.5, 8, 2.5]
                    },
                    {
                      "upper": "rightLeg",
                      "lower": "rightForeLeg",
                      "hip": [5, 11, 0],
                      "knee": [0, 5, -3],
                      "foot": [-0.5, 8, 2.5]
                    }
                  ],
                  "turnThreshold": 15,
                  "maxStepAngle": 45,
                  "stepDuration": 9,
                  "stepHeight": 3.5,
                  "stepPause": 2,
                  "strideLength": 14,
                  "minStepDuration": 4,
                  "finishDrift": 0.5,
                  "settleAngle": 3,
                  "bodyStiffness": 0.12,
                  "bodyDamping": 0.55,
                  "runSpeed": 0.09,
                  "runBodyStiffness": 1,
                  "runBodyDamping": 2,
                  "runStrideLength": 24,
                  "runStepHeight": 5,
                  "runFacingSmoothing": 4,
                  "crouch": 0.5,
                  "walkCrouch": 2,
                  "impactDepth": 1.5,
                  "impactTime": 2.5,
                  "weightShift": 1,
                  "weightRoll": 3
                }
              },
              {"core:spring": {"name": "armLag", "target": "turnSpeed", "stiffness": 0.12, "friction": 0.3}},
              {"core:spring": {"name": "armSway", "target": "stepLift", "stiffness": 0.15, "friction": 0.35}},
              {"core:spring": {"name": "jolt", "target": "stepImpact", "stiffness": 0.35, "friction": 0.6}},
              {"core:spring": {"name": "armSwing", "target": "stride", "stiffness": 0.1, "friction": 0.25}},
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {
                  "bone": "head",
                  "axis": "Y",
                  "angle": {"sub": [{"clamp": [{"add": ["headYaw", "turnLag"]}, -85, 85]}, "headYaw"]}
                },
                "@space": "PRE"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "head", "axis": "X", "angle": {"mul": ["jolt", 4]}},
                "@space": "POST"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "body", "axis": "X", "angle": {"mul": ["jolt", 2]}},
                "@space": "POST"
              },
              {"core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "body", "axis": "Y", "angle": "twist"}, "@space": "PRE"},
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "rightArm", "axis": "X", "angle": {"mul": ["armLag", -2.5]}},
                "@space": "PRE"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "leftArm", "axis": "X", "angle": {"mul": ["armLag", 2.5]}},
                "@space": "PRE"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {
                  "bone": "rightArm",
                  "axis": "Z",
                  "angle": {"add": [{"mul": ["jolt", 5]}, {"mul": ["armSway", -4]}]}
                },
                "@space": "PRE"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {
                  "bone": "leftArm",
                  "axis": "Z",
                  "angle": {"add": [{"mul": ["jolt", -5]}, {"mul": ["armSway", -4]}]}
                },
                "@space": "PRE"
              },
              {"core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "rightArm", "axis": "Y", "angle": "twist"}, "@space": "PRE"},
              {"core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "leftArm", "axis": "Y", "angle": "twist"}, "@space": "PRE"},
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "rightForeArm", "axis": "X", "angle": {"mul": ["jolt", -12]}},
                "@space": "POST"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "leftForeArm", "axis": "X", "angle": {"mul": ["jolt", -12]}},
                "@space": "POST"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "leftArm", "axis": "X", "angle": {"mul": ["armSwing", 3.5]}},
                "@space": "PRE"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "rightArm", "axis": "X", "angle": {"mul": ["armSwing", -3.5]}},
                "@space": "PRE"
              }
            ]
          },
          "@expressions": {
            "twist": {"clamp": [{"mul": ["turnLag", 0.3]}, -12, 12]},
            "vanillaRock": {
              "mul": [
                6.5,
                {
                  "div": [{"sub": [{"abs": [{"sub": [{"mod": [{"add": ["limbSwing", 6]}, 13]}, 6.5]}]}, 3.25]}, 3.25]
                },
                {"clamp": [{"floor": [{"mul": ["rawLimbSwingAmount", 100]}]}, 0, 1]}
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
